WEBVTT

00:11:25.102 --> 00:11:30.076
Sometimes, forging meaning
can give you the vocabulary you need

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:32.036
to fight for your ultimate freedom.

00:11:33.254 --> 00:11:36.090
Russia awakened me to the lemonade notion

00:11:36.114 --> 00:11:38.644
that oppression breeds
the power to oppose it.

00:11:38.995 --> 00:11:43.695
And I gradually understood that
as the cornerstone of identity.

00:11:44.496 --> 00:11:48.044
It took identity
to rescue me from sadness.

00:11:48.576 --> 00:11:50.851
The gay rights movement posits a world

00:11:50.875 --> 00:11:53.248
in which my aberrances are a victory.

00:11:53.915 --> 00:11:56.818
Identity politics
always works on two fronts:

00:11:57.354 --> 00:12:01.933
to give pride to people who have
a given condition or characteristic,